{"id":"38d4b2c7-42ad-4d08-bc20-34d5ed531632","expr":"result.length() >= name.length() - 3","rationale":"Result is a transformation from substring after 'get' or 'is' prefix, so length should be at least input length minus prefix.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#calculatePropertyFromGetter(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.870449406Z"}
{"id":"9eb442da-e738-406b-b071-6ef94e10b1a7","expr":"getter != null","rationale":"The method calls getter.startsWith and getter.substring, which require getter to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#calculateAttributeFromGetter(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.887468080Z"}
