{"id":"ec80947c-645e-4cd3-ac19-f3209cec5ff8","expr":"getter.length() > 0","rationale":"Generally, the method extracts substrings starting at index 2 or 3, requiring the string to be sufficiently long.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#calculateAttributeFromGetter(String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.887468080Z"}
{"id":"29a8b656-d53d-416b-805b-3021e2e78719","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The parameter 'method' should be non-null as it is the subject for inspection.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersGetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.918211745Z"}
{"id":"8b64a95e-393e-451c-9431-c337279787ef","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"The method's name is required and expected to be non-null for identification.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersGetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.918211745Z"}
{"id":"35f0cea1-fa2a-4b79-a4df-4fb67837bc76","expr":"method.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"The return type reflects the method signature and is expected not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersGetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.918211745Z"}
{"id":"8146ae4a-8484-4800-8016-4ea69b02cdd5","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"A method always has a non-null parameter type array, even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersGetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.918211745Z"}
{"id":"e20be6c1-cc5d-4829-8056-dcecfb3fdbdb","expr":"c != null","rationale":"The class c is used to find a specific method; hence, it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeSetParameters(Class,Object,Map):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.930265322Z"}
{"id":"661ff38e-3929-4b93-bce4-f78b4244d466","expr":"o != null","rationale":"The object o is the target of method invocation, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeSetParameters(Class,Object,Map):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.930265322Z"}
