{"id":"698a01a3-1473-40f6-a1e6-af7ef6b20826","expr":"c.getMethods() != null","rationale":"The method search depends on the methods declared by class c, which cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeSetParameters(Class,Object,Map):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.930265322Z"}
{"id":"76037b70-49af-4863-991c-20a911091a05","expr":"c != null","rationale":"The class 'c' is used to find a method by signature; it must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeGetParameters(Class,Object):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.969855595Z"}
{"id":"92060519-4199-4bf0-9e8f-7912f9b76487","expr":"o == null || c.isInstance(o)","rationale":"Since the method may be invoked on 'o' by reflection, 'o' should be compatible with type 'c' to avoid IllegalArgumentException during method invocation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeGetParameters(Class,Object):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.969855595Z"}
{"id":"6350e124-b6ba-4952-a32e-cb3c757ddda9","expr":"!c.isInterface() || o != null","rationale":"Invoking a method reflectively on a null object would fail, so if 'c' is an interface, 'o' generally must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#invokeGetParameters(Class,Object):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:13.969855595Z"}
