{"id":"afe9ab50-94dd-4662-af72-346ffee1b161","expr":"!result || method.getParameterCount() == 1","rationale":"Ensures the parameters count condition.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersSetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.013973449Z"}
{"id":"9728c669-1494-4b02-b618-7843ea0e1bf1","expr":"!result || method.getParameterCount() == 1","rationale":"If result is true then the method must have exactly one parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isPropertySetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.014245872Z"}
{"id":"7220358a-ee3b-42b7-a134-658a31150ac6","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method object must be non-null to evaluate its properties safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersSetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.030529179Z"}
{"id":"396b4f2a-2e1a-4f94-b04f-ab46522db50f","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"The method's name must be non-null to compare to \"setParameters\".","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isParametersSetter(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.030529179Z"}
