{"id":"fc1772f5-4404-4a39-878c-68837ce28e1a","expr":"obj != null","rationale":"The method likely requires a non-null obj to analyze its class and fields.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isNestedGetter(Object,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.076744960Z"}
{"id":"f9310af9-768d-4846-9ceb-539b0bbf8b5b","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter should be non-null to call its methods like getName() and getModifiers().","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#isNestedGetter(Object,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.076744960Z"}
