{"id":"a5cbc58f-a59d-4b6a-a373-a5145d77c89a","expr":"parameters == null || parameters.isEmpty() && result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If parameters is null or empty, result is an empty HashMap.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#convert(Map<String, String>,String):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.129644209Z"}
{"id":"f1c5269a-7fb9-4b36-acb3-51e58b981572","expr":"parameters != null && !parameters.isEmpty() && result.size() >= parameters.size()","rationale":"If parameters is not empty, result contains at least one mapping per parameter; it may be larger due to duplicate dot-compatible keys.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#convert(Map<String, String>,String):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.129644209Z"}
{"id":"74f0e138-af2b-4c89-b46e-d0b3b7096d1f","expr":"parameters == null || !parameters.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method returns early if parameters is null or empty, so at method entry, these cases are possible.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#convert(Map<String, String>,String):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.142451268Z"}
{"id":"627da05e-4f49-4313-9a95-53ee66ee52e6","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.length() >= 0","rationale":"prefix can be any string or null, which affects the prefixing logic in the method","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#convert(Map<String, String>,String):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.142451268Z"}
{"id":"1614cdb1-7d36-4fcc-99b9-4fb06615272c","expr":"prefix == null || !prefix.contains(\"-\")","rationale":"Given the replacement of '-' with '.' in keys, prefix likely doesn't contain '-'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#convert(Map<String, String>,String):Map<String, String>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.142451268Z"}
