{"id":"24c8a879-0028-47dc-bfdf-fbbecad2cc8e","expr":"scopeModel != null","rationale":"Method throws IllegalArgumentException if scopeModel is not an ApplicationModel, so scopeModel should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.config.AbstractConfig#checkScopeModel(ScopeModel):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/config/AbstractConfig.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:14.217870799Z"}
