{"id":"4b12c786-cf2c-44b8-9882-344510dc68db","expr":"method != null && key != null && !result.equals(\"\") || result == null","rationale":"The method likely returns null or a non-empty string because an empty string might represent absence or invalid parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameterStrict(String,String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.087912202Z"}
