{"id":"6dff75d2-8a31-4d28-bbc8-d5c6800d9ead","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns defaultValue if the retrieved value is empty, thus result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,String):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.089323153Z"}
