{"id":"3b546db3-0e22-4f54-9598-14852f91355b","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter is used as a key to get a parameter, so it must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,double):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.091549152Z"}
