{"id":"43738f7e-09ad-489c-9534-82a6a7067332","expr":"defaultValue >= Double.NEGATIVE_INFINITY","rationale":"defaultValue is of type double, so is any double value; no constraints can be inferred.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,double):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.091549152Z"}
