{"id":"ca330e72-6f58-4244-8994-9a27a0427d7b","expr":"result > 0","rationale":"getMethodPositiveParameter ensures returned value is strictly positive, either from getMethodParameter or the defaultValue which is > 0","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,float):float","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.326044102Z"}
{"id":"d4052582-6e69-4194-a1ad-b10ce7c59f5a","expr":"result >= defaultValue","rationale":"Returned value is either the 'value' from getMethodParameter if > 0, else defaultValue. So result is >= defaultValue since defaultValue > 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,float):float","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.326044102Z"}
{"id":"36d8dbf9-28e6-4c6f-8293-c03418b35e36","expr":"result > 0","rationale":"The method ensures the returned result is always positive by returning defaultValue if the obtained value is non-positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,long):long","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.363944156Z"}
{"id":"5cc9f1fc-be2d-4c6c-98fc-9efbda8c5dfb","expr":"result >= Byte.MIN_VALUE && result <= Byte.MAX_VALUE","rationale":"Result is a byte, so it must be within byte range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.378722003Z"}
{"id":"09f919f2-246d-4f5a-89f2-b772e3b8bbb4","expr":"result > 0","rationale":"The method ensures the returned value is always positive by returning defaultValue if the fetched value is non-positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,int):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.398875330Z"}
{"id":"91d7ee7d-7ee4-436d-a643-38212a2f8974","expr":"result >= defaultValue","rationale":"If the fetched parameter value is positive, it is returned; otherwise, defaultValue is returned. So result >= defaultValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,int):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.398875330Z"}
{"id":"a7723507-3594-473a-99ce-c47b1cf0befb","expr":"result > 0","rationale":"The method returns a positive value because if the retrieved value is not positive, it returns the positive defaultValue (which is > 0) instead.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,short):short","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.400340774Z"}
