{"id":"c46b37cd-9443-4003-a121-e2d03520f2e0","expr":"defaultValue > 0","rationale":"The method throws IllegalArgumentException if defaultValue is less than or equal to 0, so at entry defaultValue must be positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,int):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.419395579Z"}
{"id":"1b773de9-3336-4b72-8ee3-01c70e066921","expr":"method != null","rationale":"Method is used to look up parameters; generally expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,int):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.419395579Z"}
