{"id":"30accad1-24f3-4905-b65a-817881d3ffb1","expr":"result > 0","rationale":"The method ensures the returned byte (result) is strictly positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.445515281Z"}
