{"id":"00989e19-5fc7-4cd2-92bb-d46074eed109","expr":"method != null || key != null || result != 0","rationale":"The method and key inputs affect the returned value; they should be consistent with result presence.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.445515281Z"}
{"id":"c8f440e7-4c2c-4d73-8d2a-a3d9c210ba22","expr":"defaultValue > 0","rationale":"The method explicitly throws IllegalArgumentException if defaultValue is less or equal to zero; thus, it must be positive when entering the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.470251544Z"}
{"id":"9d0bbbae-709e-4bb0-bd3b-4b24eaac3d33","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter is expected to be a valid method name string, which is typically non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodPositiveParameter(String,String,byte):byte","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.470251544Z"}
