{"id":"1db8ee63-95f4-4be6-b686-2fc6ee52ea4d","expr":"(key.length() > 0) == (method.length() > 0)","rationale":"It is common for method and key to be either both non-empty or both empty in parameter retrieval.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,char):char","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.490741065Z"}
