{"id":"e5789ab5-a82d-43f1-b131-d33b3fdd8878","expr":"method != null","rationale":"Since the method uses method as a parameter to fetch another parameter, it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.URL#getMethodParameter(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/URL.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:20.514015630Z"}
