{"id":"328d3936-854b-4f1e-af62-dad2ed921844","expr":"msg != null || e != null","rationale":"At least one of msg or e is typically provided for debug logging.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.logger.jdk.JdkLogger#debug(String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/logger/jdk/JdkLogger.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:24.783401478Z"}
