{"id":"64957048-c472-41db-93a6-19b2cd238ccc","expr":"result.startsWith(methodName + \"(\")","rationale":"The signature string begins with the methodName followed immediately by an opening parenthesis.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getSignature(String,Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.338272352Z"}
