{"id":"6307452f-4ebc-481a-8b3f-13598f8663cb","expr":"result.length() >= methodName.length() + 2","rationale":"The returned string length must be at least the length of the methodName plus the two parentheses.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getSignature(String,Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.338272352Z"}
