{"id":"6df803fa-03a1-4c36-a29b-905ce51c4d3a","expr":"!c.isArray() || result.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"Because the method appends '[' characters for each array dimension, so if c is an array, result should start with '['.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.346788567Z"}
