{"id":"114c5cd3-19c3-4c7e-a04b-383ce589959d","expr":"result.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"The method initializes the StringBuilder with '(' and returns it, so result starts with '('","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getName(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.348034297Z"}
