{"id":"0f5426f5-d7e9-4743-adcf-861639d450e3","expr":"cs.length != 0 || true","rationale":"This is trivially true; to express that method handles empty arrays, but it's tautological and not meaningful here, so omitted.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>[]):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.349031949Z"}
