{"id":"7a1b39f3-c024-4142-b96f-38211b0e6ce6","expr":"c.isArray() || !c.isPrimitive()","rationale":"The loop processes arrays by unwrapping the component type; method handles arrays and primitives distinctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Class<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.350635454Z"}
