{"id":"f8d0a2dd-fc57-4c57-bdc9-a51b75e6c731","expr":"m != null","rationale":"The method is static and expects a non-null Method object to retrieve parameter types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescArray(Method):String[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.412269400Z"}
