{"id":"311511c5-ef41-41b9-9834-e954f4e54d3e","expr":"m.getParameterTypes().length == (m.getParameterTypes()).length","rationale":"Length of the parameterTypes array is stable during method execution; this is obvious but nontrivial in some contexts.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescArray(Method):String[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.412269400Z"}
{"id":"915f95b8-3329-4ae5-9701-b504bd29e5ba","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method builds a String by appending method name, parameter descriptors, and return type descriptor, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.415065334Z"}
{"id":"71be1ed1-1f0a-4c15-b864-1c81c99a04dc","expr":"result.startsWith(m.getName() + \"(\")","rationale":"According to the code, the string starts with method name + '('.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.415065334Z"}
{"id":"4723a498-a3af-472a-884c-2d98ad6d05de","expr":"result.contains(\"(\") && result.contains(\")\")","rationale":"The result string encloses parameter descriptors inside parentheses.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.415065334Z"}
{"id":"611e8e43-7498-4453-83b3-d1c38da743ea","expr":"result.indexOf(')') > result.indexOf('(')","rationale":"The closing parenthesis comes after the opening parenthesis in the string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.415065334Z"}
{"id":"5aa2c8e8-7e99-4191-9942-09bd42b031ed","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned descriptor string should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.422373700Z"}
{"id":"8cded975-7caa-43ce-a1bd-41230f0afccb","expr":"result.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"Descriptor strings always begin with an opening parenthesis.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.422373700Z"}
{"id":"be551f4a-6126-4514-9606-929d18585ecd","expr":"c != null","rationale":"The constructor must be non-null before attempting to get its parameter types","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.422578547Z"}
{"id":"f2620db7-9ab7-4f0c-8955-e7f5e3ec2e58","expr":"c.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"Parameter types array is never null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.422578547Z"}
{"id":"bacd5ddf-2532-4958-bd44-1d99c9eca2e3","expr":"c.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"The length of the parameter types array must be zero or more","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDesc(Constructor<?>):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.422578547Z"}
{"id":"4195c32e-8bcb-4f36-96a0-c1ca90b2c6ad","expr":"m != null","rationale":"The method m must not be null because the code calls m.getParameterTypes() and m.getReturnType() which will throw NullPointerException otherwise.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.424442884Z"}
{"id":"2ea06cc1-c97c-4e94-9629-cad39006c03f","expr":"m.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"The Java reflection API contract guarantees that getParameterTypes() returns a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.424442884Z"}
{"id":"7d8e6f2d-1a87-4d8a-a977-ef236e7faf38","expr":"m.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"The Java reflection API guarantees that getReturnType() returns a non-null Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.424442884Z"}
{"id":"0183bee1-002d-40ba-8ca1-3c64c5a9db8a","expr":"m.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"By definition, an array's length is always zero or more.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.424442884Z"}
{"id":"bd5bbb4b-6f7d-453e-a61c-785622a705ee","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the array 'arr' is initialized for the length of parameterTypes and returned, 'result' is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescArray(Method):String[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.429180911Z"}
{"id":"19d4dd8e-f81e-4f0e-9dfb-75474e08f70d","expr":"result.length == m.getParameterTypes().length","rationale":"The returned array is constructed with length equal to m.getParameterTypes().length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescArray(Method):String[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.429180911Z"}
{"id":"6ce154c6-46a8-4df2-9f72-a86dc3347c95","expr":"result.length == 0 || (m.getParameterCount() > 0)","rationale":"The result length corresponds to method parameter count, so result.length==0 implies no parameters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescArray(Method):String[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.429180911Z"}
{"id":"a885370d-a648-42f0-a60e-131c9d597a58","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method builds a string representation of the method signature, result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.432088276Z"}
{"id":"929ebcc5-7733-4ce1-8e2f-2611671db3cd","expr":"result.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"The method concatenates '(' at the start, so result must start with it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.432088276Z"}
{"id":"e682af87-e38b-4d40-93ef-99f724febbe6","expr":"result.endsWith(\")\")","rationale":"The method appends ')' before the return type descriptor, so the string must end with it or with the return type descriptor following ')'. Actually, per method code, it appends ')' right before return type descriptor. So result contains ')', but it doesn't necessarily end with ')'. So this invariant is inaccurate and should be corrected or removed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getDescWithoutMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.432088276Z"}
