{"id":"d39a5926-78c7-41cb-a242-725bab6c1266","expr":"clazz.isAssignableFrom(result.getDeclaringClass()) || clazz.equals(result.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The method searches in clazz's methods, so the declaring class of the result Method must be clazz or a superclass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.730649740Z"}
{"id":"70ca4bda-d61e-49cc-8bbc-fdd57fd8a288","expr":"result == null || result.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"A returned Method object always has a non-null return type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.730741062Z"}
