{"id":"b68dd315-fdd0-4f13-8ce5-f690b5bc05f9","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"The methodName parameter is expected to refer to a valid method name, hence non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.732126806Z"}
{"id":"0bdbbdf0-a7d3-4b78-b14c-d4be4f9437f5","expr":"methodName.length() > 0","rationale":"Method names must not be empty strings, so the length of methodName should be positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.732126806Z"}
