{"id":"2b80ef53-04a7-4184-a3e9-2d3b82381df2","expr":"method.getName().length() > 3","rationale":"Names of bean write methods have more than 3 characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyWriteMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.873023362Z"}
{"id":"896c7e1f-ff46-46fc-878b-758b962c7f73","expr":"!result || (method != null)","rationale":"If the method is a bean property write method, the method object cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyWriteMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.881730858Z"}
{"id":"9e517323-768a-43ee-a3cd-54cb3553352a","expr":"!result || (method.getParameterTypes().length == 1)","rationale":"A bean property write method takes exactly one parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyWriteMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.881730858Z"}
{"id":"8757386e-d678-443e-b143-25575c3074e0","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter should not be null to safely invoke method operations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.882238786Z"}
{"id":"725a8587-cb0c-45f0-b934-68f68399c4b9","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Reflection Method.getName() never returns null, so this invariant holds.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.882238786Z"}
{"id":"049e4c5b-b30a-432d-b165-6230ae85fe40","expr":"method.getName().length() >= 4","rationale":"Since substring(3,4) is called if the method is a bean write method, the name has to be long enough.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.882238786Z"}
{"id":"a9f8f5c7-744a-4b32-a309-8c58bb513218","expr":"field != null","rationale":"The field object must be non-null to access its methods and properties.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isPublicInstanceField(Field):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.896235550Z"}
{"id":"2055b056-2201-4657-a431-579474a9a460","expr":"result == null || (result.length() >= 1 && result.equals(method.getName().substring(3, 4).toLowerCase() + method.getName().substring(4)))","rationale":"The method returns null if method is not a bean property write method; otherwise, result is constructed from method.getName() as substring(3,4).toLowerCase() + substring(4).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.904673517Z"}
{"id":"f404e897-9b48-4940-9f76-417e7fd5977f","expr":"result == null || Character.isLowerCase(result.charAt(0))","rationale":"Result is a property name derived by converting the first character of the suffix to lowercase.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.904673517Z"}
{"id":"e78ff10d-a0e3-45be-9b37-cb9bc227a1d1","expr":"result == null || !result.isEmpty()","rationale":"The property name returned is nonempty string when not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.904673517Z"}
{"id":"0dac0943-dba7-4bd3-b02e-31302842be81","expr":"result || field.isSynthetic()","rationale":"If result is true, field is not synthetic; else it might be synthetic.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isPublicInstanceField(Field):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.926861362Z"}
{"id":"b7df45bd-bd4b-4f32-9a01-18ef7a9577ca","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a newly created HashMap, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.940867112Z"}
{"id":"835b11a7-84ad-4371-ae5d-c4c90c4b78a2","expr":"cl != null || result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If input class is null, then the map would be empty because the loop never runs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.940867112Z"}
{"id":"d6a6a663-1af0-4a27-b576-31011205254f","expr":"cl != null","rationale":"The method iterates on the class hierarchy starting from cl, so cl must be not null to begin with.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.948587075Z"}
{"id":"fa467a58-bbeb-4f8e-98c4-5dc34d0e6eab","expr":"cl.getDeclaredFields() != null","rationale":"Assuming Java standard behavior, getDeclaredFields returns an array of fields and is never null, so this invariant reflects that.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.948587075Z"}
{"id":"855771fe-36cf-4b29-821c-f1cb7e15e09a","expr":"cl.getSuperclass() != cl","rationale":"Class.getSuperclass returns the immediate superclass, which can never be equal to the class itself.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.948587075Z"}
{"id":"9b7d65ae-48d2-4841-94f2-2893f87b8b3c","expr":"cl.getName() != null","rationale":"Every Class object has a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.948587075Z"}
{"id":"33042ea8-1791-4518-8146-ed076b5966d4","expr":"cl != null","rationale":"The method loops over cl and its superclasses, so cl must be non-null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.952982016Z"}
{"id":"0fc3e9d4-837e-4864-9f23-8e0e82a4a676","expr":"cl.getDeclaredMethods() != null","rationale":"Java API guarantees getDeclaredMethods never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.952982016Z"}
{"id":"b7ef41f0-05f1-44de-8776-42256c5980f7","expr":"cl.isInterface() == false","rationale":"Ensures cl is a class, not an interface, since the method deals with properties to read.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.952982016Z"}
{"id":"23f2367b-a1f3-46e4-b1bd-bad3a8379355","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a Map, initialized as a new HashMap, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.960024250Z"}
{"id":"741a258a-8a52-45bd-b3c2-821bbd7bbcc6","expr":"cl != null || !result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If the input class is null, the result map will contain entries only if the method populated from the class hierarchy started from a non-null class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.960024250Z"}
{"id":"cbca13cd-e0a3-4270-8b4c-26e44ed1337f","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || cl == null","rationale":"If the input class is null, the result map should logically be empty, since there is no class hierarchy to inspect.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.960024250Z"}
{"id":"b0b5d1c2-57c6-4518-af15-845f87557c61","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter is expected to be non-null to retrieve return types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getReturnTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.976018091Z"}
{"id":"edac8a29-8088-4619-ae27-a87f3d67590d","expr":"method.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"Method.getReturnType() in standard Java API never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getReturnTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.976018091Z"}
{"id":"6645e4b1-d27e-4293-aca1-7b9bc045da65","expr":"method.getGenericReturnType() != null","rationale":"Method.getGenericReturnType() always returns a Type instance.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getReturnTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.976018091Z"}
{"id":"83695327-4772-49d6-8dd5-9c92a5118b54","expr":"sourceClass != null","rationale":"The method operates on sourceClass to extract generic interfaces and superclass; thus, sourceClass must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.980764965Z"}
{"id":"66e1232b-b597-44a4-a60d-ebd508a02631","expr":"sourceClass.getGenericInterfaces() != null","rationale":"The getGenericInterfaces method of Class returns a non-null array even if there are no interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.980764965Z"}
{"id":"f444582d-4ca6-4048-b076-18fe179e8b12","expr":"sourceClass.isInterface() || sourceClass.getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"Classes typically have superclass except for Object; interfaces return null for superclass.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.980764965Z"}
{"id":"4e292f0e-7b52-4149-a272-1a896fc75de0","expr":"!sourceClass.isPrimitive()","rationale":"The method operates on class types to find parameterized types, which are typically not primitives.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:29.980764965Z"}
{"id":"187c1e81-dde6-4ed4-af4a-e175b3faede0","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an unmodifiable set, which is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.001187159Z"}
{"id":"9ad1c071-7e55-4664-893c-7232ced8e8de","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || sourceClass.getGenericInterfaces().length == 0 || sourceClass.getGenericSuperclass() == null","rationale":"Result is empty only if no parameterized types found among interfaces or superclass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.001187159Z"}
{"id":"999011c7-521f-455f-b2bb-2ef575c86ff7","expr":"result.size() <= sourceClass.getGenericInterfaces().length + (sourceClass.getGenericSuperclass() == null ? 0 : 1)","rationale":"The size of the result cannot exceed the total number of generic interfaces plus superclass, since result is direct parameterized types found.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.001187159Z"}
{"id":"eef671bf-823c-4397-b02e-f97df6163056","expr":"sourceClass != null","rationale":"The method explicitly returns early if sourceClass is null, so it is non-null on entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.006552461Z"}
{"id":"82d01fcf-0b58-4ab2-b476-420f9c5fef0a","expr":"matchType != null","rationale":"The method calls matchType.isAssignableFrom(...) without a null check, so matchType must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.006552461Z"}
{"id":"e9adb445-ebd7-4870-bd29-fb6f0d881e15","expr":"matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass) || !matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass)","rationale":"The method uses matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass) in a conditional, so this predicate is meaningful at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.006552461Z"}
{"id":"669fb3c8-a3f8-4567-9144-db0ca5779138","expr":"sourceClass.getSuperclass() == null || sourceClass.getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"Superclass can be null (for Object) or non-null, so this invariant covers that.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.006552461Z"}
{"id":"eee5ba15-a428-48d2-b39f-6a20620b24ea","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null set because it either returns emptySet or an unmodifiable set.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.019809900Z"}
{"id":"d251aa13-90f8-46e6-bc85-11406ebc2d14","expr":"sourceClass == null || result.contains(sourceClass.cast(sourceClass)) || !matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass)","rationale":"If sourceClass is not null and matchType is assignable from sourceClass, then result contains sourceClass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.019809900Z"}
{"id":"b7c92f49-066c-4070-a7eb-570b92a4e569","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || sourceClass == null","rationale":"If sourceClass is null, result is empty, otherwise it can be empty or non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.019809900Z"}
{"id":"d8ad6f8a-59c5-4df5-9a67-a4d8d0fdf7f4","expr":"!result.contains(null)","rationale":"The method never adds null to the result set.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.019809900Z"}
{"id":"f02bd358-cc0f-4035-939b-9cbf97f5ed16","expr":"bean != null && methodName != null && bean.getClass().getDeclaredMethods() != null","rationale":"bean is expected to be non-null to call getClass(); methodName is expected non-null for comparison with method names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.021386203Z"}
{"id":"7f7eb06a-ff9b-491c-83dd-4bda803984d0","expr":"!methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"methodName should typically be non-empty to be meaningful for property lookup.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.021386203Z"}
{"id":"f2ed41f4-82e3-4aec-b7eb-35b4464d30c9","expr":"!bean.getClass().isPrimitive()","rationale":"bean usually is an object, not a primitive type, for introspection.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.021386203Z"}
{"id":"d1bd9a17-4b74-4b77-875c-d61df02a5ffa","expr":"bean.getClass().getMethods().length > 0","rationale":"bean's class is expected to have at least one method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.021386203Z"}
{"id":"69567230-0b06-4058-bbbb-8912a97d4e46","expr":"result == null || true","rationale":"result may be null due to invocation failing or method absence.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.024474839Z"}
{"id":"bacd2638-45a6-4397-9521-fa5c6fe035ba","expr":"result == null || bean.getClass().getMethod(methodName) != null","rationale":"If result is non-null, the method corresponding to methodName should exist on the bean class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.024474839Z"}
{"id":"84609952-9882-4caa-987e-2e3540c9ec13","expr":"beanClass != null","rationale":"beanClass must be non-null to introspect its methods","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.038564869Z"}
{"id":"be5f5991-7abb-401c-a799-e91ca5a8d329","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"methodName needs to be non-null for meaningful equals comparison with methodDescriptor names","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.038564869Z"}
{"id":"859da648-359b-44d8-a8c0-c09d46f06393","expr":"!methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"A method cannot have an empty name, so expecting methodName to be non-empty is reasonable","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.038564869Z"}
{"id":"e2d43810-a019-49d7-82e7-5c07f36e9de1","expr":"beanClass.isInterface() || beanClass.getDeclaredMethods().length > 0","rationale":"beanClass should either be an interface or have some declared methods for the method to be found","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.038564869Z"}
{"id":"7a625d03-bc23-430d-b979-feb53f85cbb2","expr":"methodName.equals(methodName.trim())","rationale":"Method names usually do not contain leading or trailing spaces, so methodName is likely trimmed","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:30.038564869Z"}
