{"id":"3e035278-0968-4d99-b2e2-cdadba153e1d","expr":"msg == null || msg.length() >= 0","rationale":"msg can be null or a valid string; no constraint to assert positivity but we can assert that if msg is non-null, it has a non-negative length","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.828815724Z"}
{"id":"f343e1b4-cbf4-4417-9a44-e3ef1a45fd63","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || true","rationale":"If info is enabled, the logger.info(msg) is called; invariant captures that the logging depends on info enabled","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.828815724Z"}
{"id":"7b4f3db6-e48a-4c9c-9cd7-52c4e6962e02","expr":"logger.isInfoEnabled() == (logger != null && logger.isInfoEnabled())","rationale":"logger.isInfoEnabled can safely be called as logger is non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.828815724Z"}
{"id":"35e698af-d5a9-4a88-a83c-3903e11f7d7d","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The early return prevents further code execution if logger is null; hence, at method exit, logger is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.831453961Z"}
{"id":"bab45c14-50d5-400a-a6ee-093cd2b335ca","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The first line in the method checks if logger is null and returns if so, so at method entry, if this point is drawn from the start of method, logger is assumed non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.831500199Z"}
{"id":"6899ce4c-c44f-4f5d-941e-906539eadc98","expr":"logger.isInfoEnabled() == false || logger.isInfoEnabled() == true","rationale":"This Boolean expression is a tautology; it is included only to document that isInfoEnabled() returns boolean. But it's trivial, so likely omit.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.831500199Z"}
{"id":"28dbe28b-b001-4e98-9764-99a49519bd99","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (logger.isInfoEnabled() && msg != null)","rationale":"If info logging is enabled, the message is used; thus, if info is enabled, msg should be the argument passed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.831453961Z"}
{"id":"65bcd5c8-9caf-4de6-8efc-278f9d762e02","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (logger.isInfoEnabled() && msg == null || msg != null)","rationale":"This is effectively tautological and should be avoided. Including here only as illustration.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.831453961Z"}
{"id":"dd405e7a-fccb-429a-982b-35b87f73aa83","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger is definitely non-null here.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.834984291Z"}
{"id":"6b3cf9ea-d525-40f3-bd1a-b7c2911fafa7","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || e != null","rationale":"If info is enabled, then logger.info(e) was called with e, so if e is null, logging with null is possible, but to be precise this reflects that e might or might not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.834984291Z"}
{"id":"3e53cc8a-0c91-4534-b3d4-1cf2cc7874d5","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger is non-null at points after the null-check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.835653674Z"}
{"id":"f8ed311d-5767-4204-b1e3-17bc2e383236","expr":"logger.isWarnEnabled() == (logger != null && logger.isWarnEnabled())","rationale":"Since logger is non-null, logger.isWarnEnabled() can be called safely and returns a boolean indicating if warning is enabled.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.835653674Z"}
{"id":"f376f755-244a-41c7-ac75-0470b8bd4585","expr":"(!logger.isWarnEnabled()) || (logger.isWarnEnabled() && true)","rationale":"logger.isWarnEnabled() returns a boolean; included for completeness and represents program branching condition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.835653674Z"}
{"id":"b565ae70-04aa-4c26-b919-9678583cf3f7","expr":"logger.getName() != null","rationale":"Assuming typical Logger implementations, name is expected to be non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.835653674Z"}
{"id":"cbebe2f4-73fa-454b-9679-429e91ac6e51","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method cannot reach the exit point with logger being null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.835764713Z"}
{"id":"c2f19f03-86e3-45db-9ebf-9fa2fb6a4cce","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (logger.isInfoEnabled() && msg != null)","rationale":"If the logger is enabled for info, logger.info is called with msg and e, so msg should be non-null to be meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.835764713Z"}
{"id":"2659f66a-0826-45a8-8cb9-8ed6946616a5","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (logger.isInfoEnabled() && e != null)","rationale":"When info is enabled, the logging method is called with exception e (which may be null but is passed).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.835764713Z"}
{"id":"af007103-6445-4e6c-8a1e-76e08c4c5933","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger is non-null on exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.836850361Z"}
{"id":"cc3b37dc-d98c-4d68-8b69-2aec4f8e7afe","expr":"!logger.isWarnEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"If warning is logged, at least one of msg or e usually is non-null to provide information.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.836850361Z"}
