{"id":"a7281fc2-72e8-40f0-8c1c-efcbb40a703f","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger must be non-null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.837744698Z"}
