{"id":"e5145770-8d4d-441c-9863-db1e69283988","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method checks if logger is null and returns early, so logger is effectively non-null after that check within the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:27:31.838310245Z"}
